                                                "sense_id": "52c23268-bc9c-378b-a983-8f0bd67f2817",
                                                "text": "In the early 1800s the French malacologist Pierre Denys de Montfort published an account of a British ship of the line that he claimed had been sunk, and its crew devoured, by a Colossal octopus, or Kraken."
                                            }
